  "problem_text": "用 Gram-Schmidt 方法将下列向量组正交化：\n$$\\alpha_1 = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} , \\quad \\alpha_2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$$",
